WEBVTT

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.500
The sky sure has an ominous aura
about it this evening.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.040
I hope that nothing bad happens.

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:15.790
Ah! It seems my stew is ready!

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:17.130
<b>DOOM</b>

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:21.000
<b>DOOM</b>

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.920
Uh oh...

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:27.130
Th-this doesn't bode well.

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:32.250
I get the feeling that
something awful will occur.

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:36.710
<b>To Kill with Love</b>

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:40.000
<b>To Kill with Love</b>

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:43.380
Ah, ah, oheo, ah, eh, ah, eh, oh

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:49.210
Ah, ah, oheo, ah, eh, ah, eh, oh

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:54.630
Hey, you over there

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:58.330
Are you... not interested in me? Oh, okay

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:00.250
Then whatever

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:04.210
Forget it. Wait no, actually please don't...

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:06.170
Ah, I just don't understand

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:09.250
I'm crushing on you super hard

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:14.000
But it's so frustrating that you don't notice it

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.250
Huh, seriously?

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:17.960
Nobody told you? You didn't know?

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:22.210
And you're saying it's a problem
that I want to know all about you?

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:25.170
How am I supposed to respond to that?

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:26.580
It doesn't even make sense!

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:29.380
"Totally inexplicable", "Beyond bizarre"

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:33.540
"What's so great about him?"
People give me that all the time

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:37.330
But they don't need to understand

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:42.630
I'm just full, full of love that pulls me and I can't stop

00:01:42.710 --> 00:01:45.330
Ah, ah, oheo, ah, eh, ah, eh, oh

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:46.750
I don't get it, what is this?

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:48.290
How can I even explain it?

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:50.960
Ah, ah, oheo, ah, eh, ah, eh, oh

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:54.210
Anyway, just promise to only have eyes for me!

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:56.460
Ah, ah, oheo, ah, eh, ah, eh, oh

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:59.080
Your heart is forbidden from wandering

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:01.710
For even a moment, for even a second

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:04.750
I want to be excited

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:07.670
So please stay with me

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:12.710
Darling! Hey, darling!

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:14.380
Are you listening to me?

00:02:14.670 --> 00:02:15.710
C'mon, please!

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:17.790
Let's do something fun!

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:19.040
Quit bugging me!

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:20.080
Good grief.

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:22.170
I'm trying to clean my room here!

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:26.290
You never clean this pigsty, except when
that stupid Shinobu comes over.

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:27.630
Get off my case already!

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:30.170
She's only coming over because we have
important business to talk about as class reps!

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:32.830
Why don't you just buzz off
to your spaceship for once?!

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:33.830
Darling!

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:35.580
That sounds like an excuse to get rid of me

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:37.630
so you can fool around
with Shinobu once I'm gone!

00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:39.670
Darling!

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:42.290
Why hello there!
Up to the same antics as usual, I see.

00:02:42.290 --> 00:02:44.460
How do you always pop in
out of nowhere? Seriously.

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:46.290
I've come to warn you!

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:48.580
I have seen what fortune has
in store for you tonight

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:49.250
and it is absolutely dreadful!

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:51.250
AHHHH! DON'T EVEN START!
I'M NOT LISTENING!
and it is absolutely dreadful!<b></b>

00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:52.540
I don't wanna hear it!

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:54.250
Well, there's this big monster
coming, ya see...

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:55.960
Darling! I'm bored out of my mind!

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:57.540
WHATEVER! SHADDUP!

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:00.330
Lum, dear.
Could you pipe down for a moment?

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:01.790
This is a serious matter
that I'm trying to talk about...

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:03.080
Who cares! You need to leave, Cherry!

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:04.830
Because we're about to get in bed together!

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:05.920
No, we are not!

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:08.580
I'm trying to warn you, dagnabbit!

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.210
Hurry and flee while there's still time!

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:11.920
Although I doubt you're going to
make it far enough!

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:13.170
THEN JUST SHUT UP ALREADY!

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.750
Fine. Once Shinobu shows up,

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:17.580
I'm taking her and then
ditching this whole scene.

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:31.000
Oh no, there's a thunderstorm.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:34.670
I better get this meeting with Ataru
over with so I can hurry back home.

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:52.960
Lum...

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:58.580
LUUUUUUM!

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:01.420
Enough! Shut that window right now!

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:04.750
I can tell you with certainty the monster
will come from that direction!

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:05.580
Shaddup.

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:07.830
Closing the window isn't gonna do squat
against a monster, anyway.

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:11.040
It's too chilly! Let's get under the covers!

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:12.790
What's taking Shinobu so long?!

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:16.460
Shinobu's dead because
the monster gobbled her up!

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:17.880
That's a load of bull!

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:22.790
Wh-what's the deal?

00:04:24.040 --> 00:04:27.210
Ataruuuu....

00:04:28.420 --> 00:04:30.040
It's a ghost!

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:30.460
Shinobu's spirit must have
come to haunt us!

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:32.250
Praise be Buddha! Praise be Buddha!
Shinobu's spirit must have<b>
</b>come to haunt us!<b></b>

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:34.210
Find peace and move on, spirit!

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:36.710
Shinobu! You poor thing!

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.830
You couldn't be at peace until you
saw me one more time, huh?

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:40.460
I'm alive, thank you very much!

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:44.540
<b>BWOAAAAAAAAAR!</b>

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:51.170
Listen, Ataru. This guy I met
keeps crying out for Lum!

00:04:51.170 --> 00:04:53.290
That's why I brought him
over to your place!

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:55.250
H-how is this a "guy"...?!

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:57.790
LUUUM!

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:01.500
Wah! It transformed!

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:02.460
Lum.

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:06.040
Ataru! Keep it down up there!

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:07.960
You'll disturb the neighbors!

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:09.750
What are you even doing here?!

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:10.420
Ataru!
What are you even doing here?!<b></b>

00:05:10.420 --> 00:05:11.830
Get lost! Go away!

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:12.210
Lum...
Get lost! Go away!<b></b>

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:12.710
Lum...
Leave! Right now! Get out!<b></b>

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:14.170
Oh my. Do we have a guest?
Leave! Right now! Get out!<b></b>

00:05:14.170 --> 00:05:14.670
Oh my. Do we have a guest?
Go on! Get out of here!<b></b>

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:17.210
Lum's ex-fiancé, apparently. His name is Rei.
Go on! Get out of here!<b></b>

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:17.630
Go on! Get out of here!

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.920
A bit old to be blushing over him, aren't ya?

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:25.710
Quiet, you!

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:27.540
I've still got time to end
my glory days on a high note!

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:30.290
Enough, Mom! You're just making
things worse, so get the hell out!

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:33.460
Lum...

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:36.750
C'mon, Lum.
Go back to your planet already.

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:40.330
Seriously. How could you pass up
on a handsome guy like this?

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:41.080
No, thanks!

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:42.960
I just don't get it.

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:44.920
Rei is such a good-looking guy.

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:46.920
As if! You saw it for yourself, Shinobu!

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:49.540
He transforms into a giant monster
the instant he gets upset!

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:51.790
I much prefer my darling here over him!

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:53.460
C-cut it out!

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.500
<b>BWOAAAAAAAAAR!</b>

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:57.750
See!

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.130
This is who he really is!

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:01.460
Rei! It's okay! Please calm down!

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:05.040
Who cares if he turns into
a monster sometimes!

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:07.000
All that matters is
how handsome he is normally!

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.670
So anything goes as long as
they've got good-looks, huh?

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:12.380
Pee-yew!

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:14.750
Get out of here, you hippo-faced tiger ox!

00:06:14.750 --> 00:06:15.880
Go on! Get!

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:16.290
Go on! Get! Go on! Get! Go on! Get!

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:17.460
Ataru, dear!
Go on! Get! Go on! Get! Go on! Get!<b></b>

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:18.790
I made some yummy steamed potatoes!
Go on! Get! Go on! Get! Go on! Get!<b></b>

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:19.330
I made some yummy steamed potatoes!

00:06:19.330 --> 00:06:21.250
Share them with your friends!

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:27.380
Wh-what the hell?!
What's all that makeup for?!

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:28.710
Here. Dig in!

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:29.460
Thanks.

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:31.710
I may be a mom, but I've still
got it going on, ya know?

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:34.630
<b>SMOOOOOOOCH</b>

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:37.380
Oh! Goodness gracious!

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:38.460
How embarrassing!

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:40.250
You're killing me with this crap, mom!

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:43.210
Oh. Hello, darling...

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:46.170
Aw shucks! Don't tell me you saw all that?

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:50.080
Come now, dear.

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:53.080
There's nothing for you to cry about!

00:06:54.130 --> 00:06:56.420
Jeez, is he always quick to
seduce women like that?

00:06:56.420 --> 00:06:57.330
No.

00:06:57.330 --> 00:06:59.170
That was just him trying to get a taste.

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:00.040
A taste?!

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:02.790
He was licking up the potato water
that was left on her hand!

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:05.000
<b>CHOMP</b>

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:05.000
<b>CHOMP</b>

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:07.630
He's a really disgusting glutton!

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:13.960
He's trying to hog them all!
Talk about being a greedy pig!

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:17.750
Waaah! I just can't stand
gross chowhounds like him!

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.880
Cut it out, Lum.
You're making him cry.

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:23.920
I'm pretty sure he's crying with joy from
how delicious those potatoes were.

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:24.750
Yep.

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.670
He's just as bad as the last time I saw him!

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:31.750
C-come on. Just think about
how handsome he is.

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:34.750
Oh please, how many times
are you going to mention that?

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:37.540
I mean, his looks are the only thing
he has going for him.

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:41.750
Save me! I don't want to be
anywhere near that slob!

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:43.420
<b>BWOAAAAAAAAAR!</b>

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:47.210
You need to learn to take "no"
for an answer already!

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:55.790
He's going on about something.

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:57.710
Ah, I see.

00:07:57.710 --> 00:07:59.830
He's talking about all the money
that he's saved up

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:01.710
to come here and propose to her.

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:03.420
I'm surprised you can understand him.

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:05.920
C'mon, Lum.
Just go back home with Rei.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:09.500
You're way better off getting married
to a fellow alien, anyways.

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:11.830
Hmph! Never in a million years!

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:13.670
<b>THE WHY OF</b>

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:13.670
<b>THE TIGER</b>

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:15.000
Lum.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:18.880
Th-the only thing my heart desires...

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:21.960
is for a life together with you!

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:23.080
Holy moly!

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:26.460
He brought a whole manual about the best
ways to propose to a woman with him!

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.170
That's underhanded.

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:30.540
You're just reciting a speech
someone else wrote!

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.250
I can tell there's no emotion behind it!

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:34.210
And that's a huge turn off!

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:40.580
I want you to spend every day by my side.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:42.460
Who are you to order me around?

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:44.330
Arrogance like that isn't going to
score you any points!

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:48.040
<b>CUE CARD</b>

00:08:49.540 --> 00:08:50.670
Please marry me!

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:52.080
Bleeeeh!

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:56.830
Darling is the only one I need in my life!

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:04.880
Why is coming he after me?!

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:06.960
Quit taking your frustration out
on everybody else!

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:19.130
No! Get away! Get awaaaaaaay!

00:09:19.130 --> 00:09:22.830
<b>Tomobiki Park</b>

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:24.750
Menko, my sweet.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:26.580
Yes, my dear Tsuyuo?

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:29.710
Menko... I want us to get married!

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:31.750
Really? Oh, Tsuyuo!

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:33.920
Sorry to butt in!

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:35.000
Pardon us!

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.000
Wha?

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:38.080
Please marry me!

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:40.420
S-sure...

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:42.500
Now that's my kind of guy.

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:44.250
I would happily spend my life with him.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:45.880
U-uh, Menko?!

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:48.080
C'mon babe, what's the big deal?

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.630
Like I was saying before...

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:51.580
Don't mind me!

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:52.830
Very sorry!

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:54.420
What the hell was th- argh!

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:55.630
Please marry me!

00:09:56.670 --> 00:09:57.630
What?

00:09:57.630 --> 00:09:59.130
Omigosh! No way!

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:02.380
That hunk totally proposed to me!

00:10:02.380 --> 00:10:03.960
He just won't quit!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:07.540
Lu.... UUUUUUM!

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:09.000
<b>BWOAAAAAAAAAR!</b>

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.920
<b>GOBBLE</b>

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:12.380
No, my food truck!

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:15.460
I guess food always gets attention
no matter what, huh?

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:17.420
Which is why I can't stand him!

00:10:17.790 --> 00:10:19.130
<b>Ramen</b>

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:18.540
Marry me!

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:19.130
Yes!

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:21.290
Marry me!

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:21.960
With pleasure!

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:22.420
Seriously?!

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:23.170
Marry me!

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:23.670
<b>Corn on the cob</b>

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:23.670
Okay!

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:25.040
S-stop it!

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:25.880
Marry me!

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:26.710
Sure thing!

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:27.290
Hey!

00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:31.750
Hey, honey?

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:33.710
I'm famished.

00:10:33.710 --> 00:10:36.330
Yeah, yeah. Dinner's almost ready.

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:38.210
Sorry to bother you.

00:10:38.580 --> 00:10:40.750
He was acting totally heartbroken
like 5 minutes ago.

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:42.580
Jeez, talk about manipulative.

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:47.880
Life just feels so meaningless doing
nothing but housekeeping every day.

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:49.000
Huh?

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:50.630
Ataru?

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:51.630
Where on earth have you been?

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:53.000
Please marry me!

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:56.790
O-oh my gosh...

00:10:58.290 --> 00:10:59.960
Kafooooom!

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:04.790
What's wrong, honey?!
Why are you on the floor?

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:07.210
Oh, it's nothing much...

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:09.250
Just feeling a little tired.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:11.880
That's not good! You need to rest!

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:14.380
I think you've got a fever!
You're burning up!

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:17.080
No. It's just a momentary thing...

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:18.790
If you say so.

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:22.710
He was undoubtedly proposing to me.

00:11:22.710 --> 00:11:26.080
Oh, Rei. You know I'm already
with someone else.

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:27.330
But...

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:29.880
If taking care of my mundane husband
and dimwitted son

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:32.290
is all that life has in store for me...

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:34.290
maybe being with Rei is the better option.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:37.210
What's all the noise about?

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:45.380
I've had it up to HERE with you!

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:46.790
That's the guy!

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:49.580
I've finally found you!

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:52.750
It's him! That's the man
who proposed to me!

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:54.000
So, hey, I thought about it
really long and hard...

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:56.080
He asked me, too!
So, hey, I thought about it<b>
</b>really long and hard...<b></b>

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:58.210
Are you the owner of that crazy ox?!

00:11:58.210 --> 00:11:59.790
You better pay for the damages!

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:01.790
How am I supposed to make a living now?!

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:03.580
Huh? ME?!

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:04.920
We've got trouble!

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:07.920
All the guys who were in the park are
coming this way and they look angry!

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:10.500
They're probably coming
to get even with Rei!

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:13.920
Where's that damn monster?!
A-Ataru! What in god's name did you do?!<b></b>

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:15.210
Gimme back my girl!
A-Ataru! What in god's name did you do?!<b></b>

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:16.920
Nothing! It wasn't me!

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:20.540
Why does this shit always happen to me?!

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:24.790
Chalk it up to fate.

00:12:31.250 --> 00:12:33.130
<b>CLASS 2-4</b>

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:36.040
<b>FREE STUDY TIME</b>

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:38.000
Everyone's just horsing around.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:41.540
No duh!
That's how "free study time" works.

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:43.750
It's absolutely disgraceful.

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:46.290
This school is truly bottom of the barrel.

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:47.790
Whatever, blowhard.

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:49.630
I don't see YOU doing any studying.

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:53.630
It's my ride.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:55.420
Come in, captain. This is End Boy.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:57.040
Young Master! Do you copy?!
Come in, captain. This is End Boy.<b></b>

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:58.670
Young Master! Do you copy?!
Can you bring the heli to pick me... hm?<b></b>

00:12:58.670 --> 00:12:59.630
Break, break!
Can you bring the heli to pick me... hm?<b></b>

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:00.170
Break, break!

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:00.790
The reception is really poor.

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:02.130
An external line is interfering with our signal!
The reception is really poor.<b></b>

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:03.830
An external line is interfering with our signal!
Is it because of a jamming signal?<b></b>

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:06.960
Do you know of anyone
associated with Channel Rei?

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:09.040
Did you say "Channel Rei"?

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:11.630
Channel...

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:12.710
Rei?

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:15.710
Say again. What do you mean
by Channel Rei?

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:17.170
Uh, guys!

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:18.670
B-behind you! Watch out!

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:25.880
<b>CLASS 2-7</b>

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:29.290
I know that voice! Is it really him?!

00:13:29.380 --> 00:13:32.880
<b>Studying Mayhem</b>

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:35.540
Hey! That's my lunch!

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:35.540
<b>MUNCH</b>

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.130
What is that thing?!

00:13:37.130 --> 00:13:38.290
I'm scared!
Have no fear! I'll keep you safe, ladies!<b></b>

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:39.130
Have no fear! I'll keep you safe, ladies!

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:42.250
There are so many other guys in here
they could have hid behind!

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:45.080
Why do the girls always go
straight for Mendo?

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:47.540
Making a pig out of himself
as usual, I see!

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:49.250
<b>MUNCH</b>

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:49.250
Jeez, he's still hanging around here?

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:51.750
Hey! What's the deal with
the pig-ox monster?!

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:53.830
Say hello to Lum's ex-fiancé.

00:13:54.130 --> 00:13:55.920
HUH?! NO FREAKING WAY!

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:57.130
It's true.

00:13:57.500 --> 00:14:00.000
This isn't the first time.
I've met him before.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.960
"Him"?! But it's clearly a beast!

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:03.670
He's incredibly handsome.

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:06.540
Handsome? Seriously?

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:07.830
Lum!

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:08.830
Stay back!

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:09.960
Miss Lum!

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.670
Allow me to protect you from this fiend!

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:12.540
Please and thank you!

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:13.210
Huh?

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:14.420
C'mon, darling!

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:17.250
Now's our chance to get out of here!

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.040
Oh!

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:20.920
Later, Mendo! I'll make good use
of your pointless sacrifice!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:22.830
That's not fair! Miss Lum!

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:26.000
Hey, Lum!

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:29.580
Rei, it's you!

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:30.630
Lum!

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:33.330
I need to borrow you for a second!

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:37.500
I knew it! Rei really is here!

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:41.080
My heart almost stopped
when I heard the sound of his voice!

00:14:41.630 --> 00:14:44.330
Oh, Lumy-poo. What should I do?

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:46.460
What do you mean? I don't follow...

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:49.580
DON'T GIVE ME THAT CRAP!
YOU KNOW I'M IN LOVE WITH REI, DAMMIT!

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:51.540
BUT I'M SHY AS ALL HELL AROUND HIM!

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:53.290
SO DO ME A SOLID AND HELP HOOK US UP!

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:54.710
Okay, I'll do it!

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:56.830
Let go! That's not yours!

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:59.210
Blech! Your face is a disgusting mess!

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:01.790
The idea of you being
Miss Lum's fiancé is totally absurd!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.710
Yo, Mendo.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.040
What is it?

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:07.880
You probably shouldn't talk
too much shit about his face.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:10.290
Whatever, good-looks are what
make men popular.

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:14.750
Yeah. You're right.

00:15:16.670 --> 00:15:18.710
Hand...some...?!

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:25.710
Food.

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:26.540
Sure!

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:27.540
Here you go!

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:28.250
Thanks.

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:29.420
You can have my lunch!

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:30.080
Thanks.

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:30.880
Same here!

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:31.920
Eat as much as you want!

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:32.710
Thanks, thanks.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:38.960
He's been shocked to his core.

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:41.630
Have you got anything to say?

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:45.420
What makes... men popular...

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:48.290
IS MONEEEEEY!

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:50.670
Yeah, right.

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:53.420
So? What's Rei doing right now?

00:15:53.420 --> 00:15:55.130
He's eating some food.

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:56.920
And being sloppy about it as usual.

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:59.040
That's what I love about him!

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:00.750
This lunch I made...

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:02.170
I want him to eat it!

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:04.040
Hey, Rei?

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:05.170
Hello.

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:07.130
Why'd you come to the school?

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:09.380
You aren't here just to eat food, right?

00:16:12.580 --> 00:16:13.670
Lum!

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:17.830
Back off! I don't know where Lum is!

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:20.880
Hey! You get off my darling
right now, mister!

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:23.380
Lum!

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:34.750
Ran...

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:38.380
Please eat this.

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:39.380
Okay.

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:44.080
It's fried shrimp. Do you like it?

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:48.290
Dang. I wish I could eat Ran's lunch, too...

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:52.710
That's an omelet. Is it good?

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:58.750
That's salad! Is it good?

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:02.920
You know, this is kinda awkward...

00:17:05.130 --> 00:17:07.920
Aw, Ran! What a sweet moment!

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:11.540
Was that tasty?

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:14.290
Lum!

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:16.580
Rei!

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:19.420
How can you still not
understand Ran's feelings?!

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:21.460
You beef for brains!

00:17:21.460 --> 00:17:23.000
Stop, Lum! That's enough.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:23.920
But Ran!

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:26.880
It's okay. I'm over the moon right now.

00:17:27.330 --> 00:17:30.170
Didn't you see?
He treated MY lunch differently!

00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:32.540
He was eating it very slowly and politely!

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:36.210
Thinking about it, he was a lot more
reserved eating hers than anyone else's.

00:17:36.210 --> 00:17:37.380
That's true.

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:41.540
That means your affection must have
gotten through to him, Ran!

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:42.330
Squee!

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:48.830
Dig in.

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:53.920
Do you like the lotus root?

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:57.750
Is the octopus tasty?

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:00.580
Are the carrots good?

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:02.000
<b>TWITCH</b>

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:02.500
Enjoying the mushrooms?

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:03.420
Uh, Ran...?

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:04.750
How about the fish cake?

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:08.960
HOW DARE YOU TREAT MY FOOD
THE SAME AS CHERRY'S STUPID SLOP!

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:10.210
Wait, Ran!

00:18:10.210 --> 00:18:12.460
Do you have any idea what you've done?!

00:18:12.460 --> 00:18:14.210
You've broken Ran's heart!

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:16.580
She'll never be the same again!

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:19.330
I went and made another lunch!

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:20.630
<b>FLOPPOOOOOOO!</b>

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:23.250
Please eat it!

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:24.290
Okay.

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:27.920
Is it good?

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:30.540
Is it better than Cherry's?

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:34.130
Squee! Oh, I'm so happy to hear that!

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:36.540
She seems just fine to me.

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:37.580
Yeah...

00:18:39.540 --> 00:18:40.750
Was it tasty?

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:47.170
Huh? Is something the matter?

00:18:47.170 --> 00:18:49.250
Murmur, murmur, murmur...

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:52.580
He's going home now
because he's gotten hungry.

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:54.670
<b>KAWAAAAM!</b>

00:18:56.670 --> 00:18:58.000
Oh, Rei...

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:00.040
Why'd he even come in the first place?

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:01.790
What a huge nuisance.

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:04.880
Just remember...
it's money that makes men popular.

00:19:04.880 --> 00:19:07.210
Rei, dear! Come back soon!

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:09.080
NEVER COME BACK AGAAAAAAAAAAAIN!

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:18.420
We're home!

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:20.750
Mom! I'm ready for dinner!

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:22.830
I've got more for you.

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.040
Here, Rei.

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.040
<b>GOBBLE</b>

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:28.420
Dude! I thought you went HOME!

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:30.040
Hello.

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:33.420
<b>GOBBLE</b>

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:36.580
Ugh... I'm so exhausted.

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:44.960
Up the tempo of the frequency for shocking electricity!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:58.210
I wonder if you also have some sad memories
that you want to forget?

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:04.960
Even unrelatable movies make me cry
due to the lack of dramatic moments between us

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:12.130
All I ever think about is absurd
and silly things like that

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:18.830
Once the rain stops, love and this side view
will belong to someone else

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:23.250
This foundation of total lies
was all built just for tonight

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:26.580
But what in the world, how on earth, why the hell?

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:30.170
How far can we go with this flickering lantern?

00:20:30.170 --> 00:20:33.130
You just threw away the whole kit and caboodle

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:35.250
You've got to be kidding me!

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:37.080
Tokyo Shandy Rendezvous

00:20:37.080 --> 00:20:40.630
Nothing can be done when that moment arrives

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:45.130
This unclear reality only makes me more melancholy

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:47.960
Come snatch me up and right now, take on me

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:51.130
Tokyo Shandy Rendezvous

00:20:51.130 --> 00:20:54.540
Nothing can be done when that moment arrives

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:59.170
This unclear reality only makes me more melancholy

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:02.540
Come snatch me up and right now, take on me, yes

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:12.170
Hey, dear?

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:14.540
Wh-what is it?

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:17.540
Listen. I've had enough.

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:18.540
Huh?!

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:20.580
It's always the same.

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:22.630
I have to put up with so many burdens.

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:25.790
And I can't take it anymore.

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:29.290
I've already filled this out.

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:34.380
And now, it's your turn to make the choice.

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:36.080
Wha?

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:37.710
H-h-hold the phone, honey!

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:39.080
We can't rush this!

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:41.750
No. I'm not waiting any longer.

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:44.130
You're the one who has to
make the decisions now.

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:53.250
Huh?!

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:56.420
<b>Tomobiki High School</b>

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:56.420
<b>PARENTS' DAY NOTIFICATION</b>

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:56.420
<b>RSVP:  Will Attend  /  Won't Attened</b>

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:56.420
W-wait, this is for...

00:21:57.380 --> 00:21:58.880
Parents' Day?

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:03.130
I hate being the one to attend parent-teacher
conference for Ataru every year.

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:06.380
I think it's more than about time
you took over that responsibility!

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:09.040
W-whew...

00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:11.080
and here I thought these were
divorce papers.

00:22:11.080 --> 00:22:12.830
Whatever gave you that idea?

00:22:13.130 --> 00:22:14.250
Nothing!

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:21.670
I have a bad feeling about
Parents' Day this year...

00:22:40.420 --> 00:22:46.000
<b>Tomobiki High School</b>

00:22:40.420 --> 00:22:46.000
<b>PARENTS' DAY NOTIFICATION</b>

00:22:40.420 --> 00:22:46.000
<b>RSVP:  Will Attend  /  Won't Attened</b>

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:51.000
<b>Parents' Day Horrors</b>

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:51.000
<b>Since Your Parting</b>

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:48.830
On the next episode of Urusei Yatsura!

00:22:48.830 --> 00:22:49.960
Bye-bye.
